        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Operations/Recruiting execute candidate communications and scheduling: timely, personalized updates at each stage (links to W3769), self-service interview scheduling (links to W3762), panel coordination across stores/DCs/HQ, and reschedule handling
