    <bpmn:process id="W_W3776" name="W3776. Candidate NPS, Funnel Analytics &amp; Offer-Decline / Drop-Off Insights" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; funnel anomaly
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise TA funnel
Owner: TA Operations / Analytics
Participants: TA Operations, Analytics (links to VS-28.1), TA Marketing (links to W3761), HR (links to VS-103), CHRO, Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W3776 — Candidate NPS, Funnel Analytics &amp; Offer-Decline / Drop-Off Insights</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3776_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3776_Lane1" name="TA Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3776_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3776_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3776_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3776_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3776_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3776_Start3" name="Reporting cycle; funnel anomaly">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3776_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3776_Task4" name="TA Operations/Analytics maintain the TA funnel and candidate-NPS measurement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Operations/Analytics maintain the TA funnel and candidate-NPS measurement: apply→screen→interview→offer→hire conversion by role/entity/region/source, candidate-NPS at disposition, offer-acceptance rate, and offer-decline/drop-off reasons (links to W3773)
Responsible (R): TA Operations / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3776_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3776_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3776_Task5" name="TA Operations/TA Marketing analyze drop-off and decline drivers (pay gap links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Operations/TA Marketing analyze drop-off and decline drivers (pay gap links to VS-102, process speed, competitor offers, experience friction) and translate into corrective actions across EVP (W3761), journey (W3769), sourcing (W3771), and offers (W3773)
Responsible (R): TA Operations / TA Marketing
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3776_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3776_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3776_Task6" name="TA Operations publish TA-scorecard (time-to-fill, cost-per-hire…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Operations publish TA-scorecard (time-to-fill, cost-per-hire, quality-of-hire, candidate-NPS, source-mix, diversity links to W3767) to CHRO and executive (links to VS-33.2/VS-36), and drive continuous improvement
Responsible (R): TA Operations / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Lead / CHRO
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3776_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3776_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3776_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3776_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3776_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-593 (ensure controlled execution — Candidate Experience, Sourcing &amp; Selection Operations (PA-121.2).) | - operational: scorecard and driver analysis; operational: quality-of-hire tracking and links to VS-103
Owner: TA Operations / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
